pkg:Evidence_v1_7_0 a quality:Evidence, owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Gate transcript for code-abundance-rdodi v1.7.0 (MINOR release)"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "MINOR: user asked for a full revisit of the mission-scope-goal-objective chain before any roadmap/planning work begins. Re-verified all 8 shapes currently targeting Mission in the shapes file (backlog_shacl_v1_73_0.ttl): all already satisfied. Re-confirmed the G28 scope-area derivation from the prior pass still holds unchanged. Closed the one remaining substantive gap: built the 3 missing mission-facing Goals (G29's own closure test), one per mission clause, each with a real Objective measuring that clause's CURRENT standing truth (distinct from the scope-facing objective, which measures this lineage's own area completion) -- Clause 1 (gate-verifiable at every stage): 3/4 RDODI stages fully clean, Stage 4 partial, re-checked directly. Clause 2 (discloses limits): 2/2 disclosed limitations confirmed still visible. Clause 3 (keeps pace with Stage 4's standard): honestly 0/1 -- the current artifact does not yet match the currently-governing default, which is precisely the gap this Epic exists to close. Re-ran G29's own closure test directly against the final register: 8 goals total, correctly split 3 mission-facing / 1 scope-facing / 1 containment-facing / 3 exclusion-facing -- complete by construction. Re-closed Stage_Goal/Objective/Backlog with recomputed digests (16/24/29 subjects) across two commits (content, then closedAtCommit backfill), matching this package's established two-step pattern. Re-verified after every step: pipeline order (5/5 digests reproduce), full SHACL 0 violations (116 warnings, all legitimate disclosures)."@en ;
    pub:transcriptSHA256 "f889673d6669042610c90914fe11bd017a7f8adf84ffcdb6c668c4e200ae31e0"^^xsd:string .
